kbase_kmod.c states target range r32p0-r44p0 (JM uAPI 11.x / CSF uAPI 1.x).
  Poco X6 Pro DDK version still to be confirmed at runtime (VERSION_CHECK).
apply-patches.sh copies this tree over the Mesa checkout AFTER applying
*.patch files. Never edit these copies in the Mesa tree; fix forward here.

011 (2026-09-19, G615 bring-up): NEED_MMAP import fix. This DDK reports
  NEED_MMAP (not SAME_VA) for dma-heap imports: req.out.gpu_va is the real
  GPU VA (observed 0x41000) with a separate CPU mapping. same_va now tracks
  BASE_MEM_SAME_VA only; gpu_va = req.out.gpu_va for NEED_MMAP imports.
  New cpu_gpu_coherent flag (from BASE_MEM_COHERENT_SYSTEM) skips
  KBASE_IOCTL_MEM_SYNC for system-coherent regions (EINVAL on this DDK).
